      en: ["The station was constructed between 1958 and 1966.", "It was designed by architects Sampaio, Castro, and Carmo.", "The building is a prime example of Portuguese modernism.", "It connects Beira's port to landlocked Zimbabwe.", "The structure features large murals and decorative concrete work.", "It remains a functioning hub for the Mozambique Railways (CFM)."],
