      en: ["Originally established in 1610 as a Jesuit educational college.", "Became the Governor's official residence in 1763.", "The museum houses a premier collection of Indo-Portuguese furniture.", "The building is easily identified by its vibrant red exterior.", "Designated as a UNESCO World Heritage site in 1991.", "Served as the seat of government until the capital moved in 1898."],
