      en: ["Officially opened in May 1915.", "Designed by the architect Manuel João do Carmo.", "Architecture features a mix of eclecticism and Art Deco.", "Located on the prominent Samora Machel Avenue.", "Served as both a cinema and a theatre in the colonial era.", "Nationalized after Mozambique gained independence in 1975."],
