      en: ["FEIMA stands for Fair of Craft, Flowers, and Gastronomy.", "Located within the scenic Parque dos Continuadores in Maputo.", "Well-known for high-quality ebony wood carvings and beadwork.", "Features a wide array of stalls serving authentic Mozambican cuisine.", "Provides a more relaxed shopping experience compared to Baixa markets.", "Regularly hosts live cultural performances and art workshops."],
