      en: ["The water tower is located in Chimoio, the capital of Manica.", "It was constructed during the Portuguese colonial administration.", "Designed to supply water to the former town of Vila Pery.", "The tower remains one of the tallest structures in the city center.", "It serves as a key landmark along the international Beira Corridor.", "The site offers views of the surrounding Manica highlands."],
